Patch for impressncsu/ICCV2025_MSLR at 7dd73c4e67b2959a95f828c103269723528b9271.

Concern: hardcoded data paths (correctness/containerization only).
Why necessary: the published scripts hardcode the authors' Windows data
directories (and leave Pose_estimation/demo.py's input/output paths empty),
and val_md_gen.py / val_video_resized.py select the split by a hand-edited
DIR = "Test" line. In the container these become environment variables:
MSLR_TRAIN_DIR, MSLR_VAL_DIR, MSLR_TEST_DIR, MSLR_SPLIT ("Test" or "Val"),
POSE_INPUT_DIR, POSE_OUTPUT_DIR. No other line changes; behaviour is unchanged.
fusion_pred_trainval.py (internal 80/20 fusion-weight search, out of scope)
is left untouched.

